# PiGigz — server environment variables
# Names only. NEVER put real values in this file and never commit them.
# On Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables (Production + Preview).
# Locally: copy this file to `.env` and fill the values there (`.env` is git-ignored).

# The app's Server API Key from the Pi Developer Portal
# (PiGigz app → Settings → API key — shown in full only once, when generated).
# Used server-side only, to approve/complete user_to_app payments and to
# create app_to_user payouts. While unset, ordering runs the clearly labeled
# Testnet simulation instead of real payments.
PI_NETWORK_API_KEY=

# The app wallet's secret seed (starts with "S"), from the app wallet setup
# in the Pi Developer Portal. Used server-side only, to sign the app_to_user
# payout transaction on the Pi Testnet blockchain. While unset, payouts are
# simulated (instant release) instead of sent on-chain.
PI_WALLET_SEED=
